  {
   "@id": "https://kgx.foaf.tv/id/toolbuildkgx",
   "@type": "prov:Activity",
   "rdfs:label": "build-kgx",
   "dct:description": "Every step is a logged operation (tools/kgx-ops.mjs, skill cwplans-dataflow) over inputs fixed by content hash. Lift operations turn the source files into one graph version each (facts, buildings with WKT outlines, occupants, cwg with daily opening-hours specifications, web, coref per key rule, mallmap units and facilities, storeguide entries, pipeline provenance from pipeline.jsonld with blank nodes skolemized); partition-by-subject-key cuts each version into parts of about 3,000 triples in Shardborough zone-key order; describe-graph-versions makes meta (void:Dataset per version and part, heads); lift-activity-log makes log; pack-shardborough packs the parts, meta and log (ibk5) and activates the generation. Writes graphs/<name>/<hash16>.nq.gz, log/activities.jsonl and versions.jsonl, heads.json, current.nq.gz, manifest.json and shardborough/ into danbri/londat kgx/. An activity already in the log is not run again; a second run gives the same generation.",
