    "F32",
    "F33",
    "F34",
    "F35"
   ],
   "cwp:judgement": "The status windows (7, 5 and 2 years), the \"major\" filter and the match distances are judgements, recorded in the tool header, meta.status_rules and meta.match_rules and the cwplans-construction skill. facts.json is hand-written from crawled pages and the owner's photos (crawl list inside it)."
