   "cwp:judgement": "Owner decision 2026-10-04: AISHub and aisstream.io events are kept for scoping (licence class scoping-accepted-2026-10-04), marked for review before scaling or commercial use. Before that decision: Open Waters re-serves each event under its upstream source's terms. Only open licences were kept (CC0 single volunteer receptions, NLOD, CC BY). AISHub (a private written assurance reported by Open Waters, revocable) and aisstream.io (no terms) are not kept without the owner's agreement; on 2026-10-04 they were the whole vessel coverage of the zone, so 0 vessels were kept and 3 CC0 aids to navigation."
  },
