   "dct:description": "Reads stations.glb from the export zip (GLB JSON and binary chunks, no library), merges the per-face vertices of each object to positions in cm relative to the object's origin, drops the text labels and the street reference plane, and writes the minimum-area plan rectangle (+1.5 m) of each structural box and an OSM level to m OD table per station taken from named model floors.",
