    "registry/sources/lighting/crown-lighting.json (read, confidence, hex_kind per record)",
    "skills/cwplans-crown-lighting/SKILL.md"
   ],
   "cwp:gap": "The pixel measurements were run from the session scratchpad (a 10-line Pillow script: crop, sort by brightness, mean of the top fraction); the boxes are in no committed file."
